{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7710","id":5211812192,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNqXxYA","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7710","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7710.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7710.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7710","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7710/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7710/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7710/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/870a6979ef3cb93fb575dc570034dec0ceef72e3","number":7710,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"doc(id): curated-board submissions decision record — intake queues, intake roles, notifications (#5857)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Decision record for #5857 (decomposition item 5 of parent #5680). **Docs only** — no implementation.\n\n## What the record decides\n\n- **A board declares its intake policy** as a signed, versioned `IntakePolicy` object with two modes only — `open` (the default, and the absence of a policy) and `curated`. The owner alone sets it; moderators cannot remove a queue.\n- **Intake authority is a separate board-scoped role**, `BoardRole::Intake`, granted and revoked by owner-signed `RoleAttestation`. A `Moderator` grant does not imply `Intake` or vice versa: admitting content and moderating published content have different audit consequences.\n- **A submission is a real signed post plus a signed `IntakeDecision`** (`admit` / `decline` / `unadmit`). Provenance is fixed at submission, so approval cannot rewrite the post. Pending/admitted/declined are **derived** from the signed set, never a stored flag; competing decisions resolve by the same deterministic content-hash order `resolve_rules` already uses.\n- **Hidden is not erased**: pending, declined and unadmitted posts stay in the graph and are reported with their layer and reason in `compose_view`.\n- **Notifications are intake events delivered by #5862's `notify_mode`/mute** — no second channel, mute or default. Submitters always get their own decision, followers hear admissions only, deciders hear `submitted`.\n- **No silent admission** on a mode switch; bulk admission names each submission.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Baseline `origin/main` at `83b7a024b8`; verified `pkgs/id/src/boards.rs` has no intake/queue/notification object: `BoardRole` is `Moderator` only, `Post` carries no pending state, and the only state changes are `ModerationAction`/`Supersede`/`Tombstone`.\n- Applies rather than forks #5856 (PR #7605), #5862 (PR #7586), #5830 (PR #7581) and #2054's three-layer view.\n- Docs-only: one new file under `doc/` plus one row in `doc/README.md`. No code, tests, or config touched.\n\nRefs #5857.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796737417&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7710&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7710&signature=5df7580fdd74b2307ef63dbabd3b4e72ffedc314f1cf5fc4550691a3fa5d3882\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7710?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-08T13:43:34Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:15:11Z","closed_at":"2026-11-10T21:15:08Z","merged_at":"2026-11-10T21:15:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"79b0418f7e16fb4018f70fda4aca7c05057b73ef","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[{"id":7767549,"node_id":"T_kwDOAZNvF84AdoX9","url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549","members_url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549/members{/member}","name":"codeowners","description":"Team Discussions: developing-today/code","permission":"pull","privacy":"closed","notification_setting":"notifications_enabled","html_url":"https://github.com/orgs/developing-today/teams/codeowners","repositories_url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549/repos","slug":"codeowners","type":"org